<div class="paragraph">
<p>You can explore these integrations in depth on the <a href="mathjax.html">mathjax.html</a>, <a href="mathematical.html">mathematical.html</a>, and <a href="asciimath-gem.html">asciimath-gem.html</a> pages.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>If you&#8217;re planning to convert to DocBook to leverage the DocBook toolchain, be sure to consider <a href="docbook.html">docbook.html</a> when deciding which STEM notation to use in your AsciiDoc document.</p>
</div>
